Z||000005||FieroMaster88||10-15-2001||01:18 PM||||Sorry I hadnt replied sooner.  I have been having computer problems.   But like everyonje else said, YES, the isuzu works GREAT with the V6.  There are 2 choices with the shift cables.  Run them over the intake tube or under the intake tube.  Mine are under and work just fine!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  You can kinda see them in this picture....<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/MY_engine_2.jpg"> <P>If you have any other questions, drop me a PM.<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jamessig.jpg">                  <BR>James Essar<BR>AOL IM Name: FieroMaster88<BR>Not your ordinary 88 coupe!||||reg||1
